Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 21:37:27 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat: list agents under their space in the sidebar

Each space in the expanded sidebar (local and multi-machine) lists its
agents underneath, and clicking one focuses that agent. The agent
section below only shows agents that need input and only takes room
while one does, up to the draggable split.

